  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APEC Sub-Fund for Climate Regulation Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a New Zealand-funded Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) sub-fund to support climate mitigation, adaptation and resilience, with a specific focus on the nine developing APEC Member Economies. This fund will build capability to develop tailored green structural reforms that can be shared, measured and, where relevant, transferred to other developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
